# Woodright commercial/legal website SoT

Before changing or generating buyer-facing content or behavior related to delivery, shipping, payment, warranty, claims, returns, after-sales service, order acceptance, natural-material disclaimers, or Bespoke commercial terms, read this file first:

`docs/content-audit/SITE_COMMERCIAL_SERVICE_SOT.md`

Do not invent commercial/legal facts. Owner decisions recorded there override older contract-derived website assumptions. Unresolved contract conflicts must remain explicit gates.

This rule does **not** duplicate the SoT. The Markdown file is the only detailed source.

Do not ship contract tariffs, a universal lead time, on-site acquiring, public bank details, or contract §5.10 returns wording unless that SoT marks them as currently publishable.
